00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:39.240
and Naoya Sakamata for performing this end
theme.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:43.630
You can find the links to their channels in
the credit section at the bottom of the description.

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:47.690
Let me know in comments what other rides I
should write a scary about, but before you

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:53.050
exit this ride, please stop by our gift shop,
where you can find the new CZsWorld Like Pillows,

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:55.430
with 17 different color options.

00:12:55.430 --> 00:13:00.840
Remember to subscribe to CZsWorld for new
horrors every week, ring that deathbell for

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.590
notifications and I’ll see you in the next
one.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:07.220
Assuming we both survive.

